@startuml
!include ../../common/style.puml
title e2a_inherited with a generated base and a scaffold
participant "Caller" as C
participant "DeveloperPlatform\nWorkflow" as W
participant "E2AInherited\nClassGenerator" as I
participant "Claim store" as S
participant "E2AAbstract\nClassGenerator" as A
participant "P0" as P
participant "llm_service" as L
participant "Critic" as K
C -> W : generate(request, config)
W -> I : factory → generate(request, config)
I -> I : 1–3 resolve · validate · policy
I -> S : 4 claim g2c:<generator_key>
S --> I : CLAIMED\n(REPLAY → stored result, stop)
I -> A : 5–6 generate(abstract request)\nshared per tenant
A -> L : _infer(E2A specification)
A -> K : review: 9 classes
A --> I : common/e2a_base.py\n(or replay)
I -> P : 7–8 bootstrap(scaffold)
P --> I : ScaffoldResult\n{project_root, dev_request}
I -> I : copy base into <project_root>/common/
I -> L : 9–11 prompt with base
I -> K : 12 review: base, hooks,\nrun() intact
I -> I : 13–14 write class;\nSLO; log
I -> S : complete(result)
I --> W : GeneratorResult
W -> W : register base\nreference (CAS)
W --> C : flat GeneratorResult
@enduml
